  "step_2": "Applying the decision reason: the reason prefers the lottery that is more left-skewed. Lottery B has all probability on a favorable outcome (1000), so it is more left-skewed than Lottery A, which has equal probability on favorable (+3000) and unfavorable (-3000) outcomes. Therefore, the decision reason prefers Lottery B.",
